[Music]  our clients priority is the privacy and  security of the house  this led us to explore design approaches  that fortify but yet will not impede  their enjoyment of this very large  compound an introverted and secure  environment yet spatially and  experientially not limited  nor compressed by this fortification the  challenge was how  we could make a quality family space for  day-to-day living  and home with different spaces for  entertainment parties  and cozy smaller fats within this  protected compound  during the early stage of putting the  plants together  we studied and analyzed the forms of  courtyards in history  and different parts of the world  traditionally  koya houses are symmetrical hierarchical  and highly ordered spaces  the cloister house which is designed  with multiple courtyards  followed a non-hierarchical structure  instead we found that this fluid  structure is very important  for modern families like our clients  since they have young kids  whose lifestyles tend to change over  time this structure also allows the  family to continually adjust  and adapt the spaces within the house  for different uses  from the start we wanted a series of  multiple pitch roofs  instead of a single roof for this single  story deep plan  the initial iteration was a grid of  interconnected  hip roofs terminating with skylights in  their apexes  then we had an aha moment while working  on the model we suddenly flipped the  roofs upside down  and realized that this achieved a couple  of things not only did it scale down the  house by changing the relationship of  the roof  with the interiors the sloping roofs  connect the courtyards to become part of  the living spaces  instead of having skylights that are not  really the most tropical means of  daylighting  the deep interior will be lit ventilated  and  cooled passively with this courtyard  scattered throughout the house  we believe that cloister house  represents a new form of luxury living  in the tropics  it shows how you can still live richly  and have a wealth of experiences within  a single story house  you

